(ns association.facts
  "Industry rule/history catalog for the Federation of Thai Industries
  (FTI), ISIC 9411, per ADR-2607141700
  (cloud-itonami-compliance-fact-federation).

  GENERATED by scripts/gen_sources.cljk from data/datascript-tx.edn, which
  is the source of truth. Do not edit: run the generator.

  Of the 20 entries, 19 are cited to fti.or.th or mit.fti.or.th --
  the federation's own domains -- and the rest to en.wikipedia.org. Every
  citation carries the substring it claims is on the page, recorded in
  data/citation-evidence.edn and re-fetched by
  scripts/verify_citations.cljk, because an HTTP 200 is returned by a page
  that has been rewritten, emptied, or replaced by a login wall just as
  readily as by the page the entry was written against.

  An association not in `catalog` has NO spec-basis, full stop; never
  fabricate one.")

